# Eval/audit artifacts (generated by unified-eval-edit skill)
# STATUS 2026-08-04: excluded from THIS repo because its remote, mjrgman/AI-EHR, is PUBLIC.
# These are internal security-review and remediation records - SECRETS_FINDINGS, GAP_MAP,
# BLIND_EVALUATION_REPORT, TIER fix logs. Michael confirmed the project is demo data with no
# PHI, which settles patient data; publishing a security audit to a public repo is a separate
# question and the answer was no.
# They are NOT lost. Commit c07f46a, which added all 32 of them, is preserved on the local-only
# branch `local-archive/eval-docs` and captured in the nightly offsite git bundle. They are
# backed up; they are simply not published.
_eval/
_eval_*
_eval_test

# Manuscript scratch files (belong in AI_Book repo, not here)
docs/BOOK_SSOT_*.md

